#: src/modules/Clientfence/templates/admin/mod_clientfence_signin_panel.html.twig
msgid "After the right password, a 6-digit PIN goes to the email of the login, and signing in needs it. It works once, for 10 minutes. Clients who sign in with an authenticator app or with Google are not asked. Staff who set up an authenticator app on their Profile page can enter its code instead. \"Trust this browser for 30 days\" skips the PIN on a known browser until the password changes."
msgstr "Po pravilnem geslu gre 6-mestna koda PIN na e-poštni naslov prijave in prijava jo zahteva. Deluje enkrat, 10 minut. Stranke, ki se prijavljajo z aplikacijo za preverjanje pristnosti ali z Googlom, niso vprašane. Osebje, ki na strani Profil nastavi aplikacijo za preverjanje pristnosti, lahko namesto tega vnese njeno kodo. \"Zaupaj temu brskalniku 30 dni\" preskoči kodo PIN v znanem brskalniku, dokler se geslo ne spremeni."

#: src/modules/Clientfence/templates/admin/mod_clientfence_setup.html.twig
msgid "After the right password, a 6-digit PIN goes to the staff member's email. Turning it on first emails you a PIN, so email sending must work."
msgstr "Po pravilnem geslu gre 6-mestna koda PIN na e-poštni naslov člana osebja. Ob vklopu vam najprej pošlje kodo PIN, zato mora pošiljanje e-pošte delovati."

