msgid "Clients can also pay an invoice without setting up automatic payments."
msgstr "Stranke lahko račun plačajo tudi, ne da bi nastavile samodejna plačila."

#: src/modules/Order/templates/admin/mod_order_settings.html.twig
msgid "Clients can move an active service to another product or billing cycle from its page. The price is prorated: the unused part of the current period is credited, an upgrade is invoiced and applied when paid, and a downgrade credit goes to the client's account balance. Each product, and each service, can also allow or block them."
msgstr "Stranke lahko aktivno storitev na njeni strani prestavijo na drug izdelek ali obračunsko obdobje. Cena je sorazmerna: neporabljeni del trenutnega obdobja se dobropiše, prehod na višji paket se zaračuna in uveljavi ob plačilu, dobroimetje za prehod na nižji paket pa gre na stanje računa stranke. Vsak izdelek in vsaka storitev jih lahko tudi dovoli ali blokira."

#: src/modules/Servicehosting/templates/admin/mod_servicehosting_config.html.twig
msgid "Clients can restore backups"
msgstr "Stranke lahko obnovijo varnostne kopije"

#: src/library/Payment/Adapter/PayTabs.php
msgid "Clients can save a card on their Payment methods page without paying an invoice (PayTabs checks the card without charging it)."
msgstr "Stranke lahko na strani Načini plačila shranijo kartico, ne da bi plačale račun (PayTabs kartico preveri, ne da bi jo bremenil)."

#: src/library/Payment/Adapter/Eway.php
msgid "Clients can save a card on their Payment methods page without paying an invoice."
msgstr "Stranke lahko na strani Načini plačila shranijo kartico, ne da bi plačale račun."

#: src/library/Payment/Adapter/Mollie.php
msgid "Clients can save a card or PayPal account on their Payment methods page without paying an invoice (Mollie checks it without charging it)."
msgstr "Stranke lahko na strani Načini plačila shranijo kartico ali račun PayPal, ne da bi plačale račun (Mollie ga preveri, ne da bi ga bremenil)."

#: src/library/Payment/Adapter/Mollie.php
msgid "Clients can save a card or bank account at Mollie and their invoices are then charged to it automatically. Turn it off if recurring payments are not enabled for your Mollie account; clients then pay each invoice on Mollie's page."
msgstr "Stranke lahko pri Mollie shranijo kartico ali bančni račun in njihovi računi se nato samodejno bremenijo nanj. Izklopite to, če ponavljajoča se plačila za vaš račun Mollie niso omogočena; stranke nato vsak račun plačajo na strani Mollie."

#: src/modules/Invoice/templates/admin/mod_invoice_settings_cards.html.twig
msgid "Clients can save a card with Stripe, or their PayPal account (PayPal settings: Saved PayPal accounts), when they pay or on their Payment methods page. The method they saved or chose last is charged automatically for unpaid invoices that have no payment method or one of these."
msgstr "Stranke lahko ob plačilu ali na strani Načini plačila shranijo kartico pri Stripe ali svoj račun PayPal (nastavitve PayPal: shranjeni računi PayPal). Za neplačane račune brez načina plačila ali z enim od teh se samodejno bremeni način, ki so ga shranile ali izbrale nazadnje."

#: src/library/Payment/Adapter/PayPalEmail.php
msgid "Clients can save their PayPal account when they pay or on their Payment methods page, and their invoices are then paid automatically, as with saved cards. Needs the REST API keys and the Vault (\"Save payment methods\") on your PayPal REST app, which PayPal offers in some countries only."
msgstr "Stranke lahko ob plačilu ali na strani Načini plačila shranijo svoj račun PayPal in njihovi računi se nato plačujejo samodejno, kot s shranjenimi karticami. Potrebni so ključi REST API in Vault (\"Save payment methods\") v vaši aplikaciji PayPal REST, ki jo PayPal ponuja le v nekaterih državah."

#: src/library/Payment/Adapter/GoCardless.php
msgid "Clients can set up a Direct Debit on their Payment methods page without paying an invoice."
msgstr "Stranke lahko na strani Načini plačila nastavijo direktno bremenitev, ne da bi plačale račun."

#: src/library/Payment/Adapter/PayPalAutoPay.php
msgid "Clients can set up automatic payments on their Payment methods page without paying an invoice."
msgstr "Stranke lahko na strani Načini plačila nastavijo samodejna plačila, ne da bi plačale račun."

#: src/modules/Client/templates/admin/mod_client_settings.html.twig
msgid "Clients can turn marketing email off on their profile. Every Mass Mailer email gets an unsubscribe link and one-click unsubscribe headers, and Mass Mailer skips clients who opted out. Service email (invoices, tickets, sign-in) always goes."
msgstr "Stranke lahko na svojem profilu izklopijo trženjsko e-pošto. Vsako sporočilo Množične pošte ima povezavo za odjavo in glave za odjavo z enim klikom, Množična pošta pa izpusti stranke, ki so se odjavile. Storitvena e-pošta (računi, zahtevki, prijava) se pošilja vedno."

#: src/modules/Invoice/templates/admin/mod_invoice_settings_receipts.html.twig
msgid "Clients can upload a payment receipt on an invoice. Each receipt opens a support ticket, so your team can confirm the payment."
msgstr "Stranke lahko na računu naložijo potrdilo o plačilu. Vsako potrdilo odpre zahtevek za podporo, da lahko vaša ekipa potrdi plačilo."

#: src/library/Payment/Adapter/Custom.php
msgid "Clients can upload a receipt:"
msgstr "Stranke lahko naložijo potrdilo:"

#: src/modules/Clientfence/templates/admin/mod_clientfence_settings_store.html.twig
msgid "Clients can’t see the store or order. Staff can still create orders for them in the admin area."
msgstr "Stranke ne vidijo trgovine in ne morejo naročati. Osebje lahko zanje še vedno ustvarja naročila v skrbniškem delu."

#: src/modules/Invoice/templates/admin/mod_invoice_settings.html.twig
msgid "Clients choose an amount on the Wallet page and get one email when their balance falls below it."
msgstr "Stranke na strani Denarnica izberejo znesek in prejmejo eno e-poštno sporočilo, ko njihovo stanje pade pod ta znesek."

#: src/modules/Client/templates/admin/mod_client_settings_affiliates.html.twig
msgid "Clients find the program on the Affiliates page of the client area. Staff can make any client an affiliate on the client's Affiliate tab."
msgstr "Stranke najdejo program na strani Partnerji v območju za stranke. Osebje lahko katero koli stranko naredi za partnerja na zavihku Partner te stranke."

#: src/modules/Invoice/ServicePayGateway.php
msgid "Clients have saved payment methods on this gateway. Disable it instead of deleting it."
msgstr "Stranke imajo pri tem prehodu shranjene načine plačila. Namesto brisanja ga onemogočite."

#: src/modules/Clientfence/templates/admin/mod_clientfence_signin_panel.html.twig
msgid "Clients in scope, and the authorized users of their accounts, must set up an authenticator app: until they do, every client page after sign-in goes to the two-factor setup. Staff \"Login to Client Area\" is not asked. Staff can still switch the app off for a client who lost a phone: the client sets it up again at the next sign-in."
msgstr "Stranke v obsegu in pooblaščeni uporabniki njihovih računov morajo nastaviti aplikacijo za preverjanje pristnosti: dokler tega ne storijo, vsaka stran za stranke po prijavi vodi na nastavitev dvostopenjske prijave. Pri \"Prijava v območje za stranke\" osebja to ni zahtevano. Osebje lahko aplikacijo še vedno izklopi za stranko, ki je izgubila telefon: stranka jo znova nastavi ob naslednji prijavi."

#: src/modules/Client/templates/admin/mod_client_settings_id_documents.html.twig
msgid "Clients in these groups"
msgstr "Stranke v teh skupinah"

#: src/modules/Client/templates/admin/mod_client_settings_affiliates.html.twig
msgid "Clients may join by themselves"
msgstr "Stranke se lahko pridružijo same"

#: src/modules/Clientfence/templates/admin/mod_clientfence_signin_panel.html.twig src/modules/Support/templates/admin/mod_support_helpdesk_mail.html.twig
msgid "Clients only"
msgstr "Samo stranke"

#: src/modules/Support/templates/admin/mod_support_settings.html.twig
msgid "Clients rate each staff reply from 1 to 5 stars on the ticket page; Support > Ratings & Feedback shows the results. The feedback email when a ticket closes is set on each help desk."
msgstr "Stranke na strani zahtevka ocenijo vsak odgovor osebja z 1 do 5 zvezdicami; Podpora > Ocene in povratne informacije prikaže rezultate. E-poštno sporočilo s povratnimi informacijami ob zaprtju zahtevka se nastavi pri vsakem oddelku za podporo."

#: src/modules/Support/templates/admin/mod_support_ratings.html.twig
msgid "Clients rate each staff reply from 1 to 5 stars, and score each staff member from 1 to 10 in the feedback form emailed when a ticket closes. Reply ratings are switched on in Support settings; the feedback email on each help desk."
msgstr "Stranke ocenijo vsak odgovor osebja z 1 do 5 zvezdicami in vsakega člana osebja z 1 do 10 v obrazcu za povratne informacije, poslanem po e-pošti ob zaprtju zahtevka. Ocene odgovorov se vklopijo v nastavitvah podpore; e-poštno sporočilo s povratnimi informacijami pri vsakem oddelku za podporo."

#: src/modules/Support/templates/admin/mod_support_network_issue.html.twig
msgid "Clients see it on the Network Status page; those it affects also see a banner while it is open or scheduled."
msgstr "Stranke ga vidijo na strani Stanje omrežja; tiste, na katere vpliva, vidijo tudi pasico, dokler je odprt ali načrtovan."

#: src/modules/Product/templates/admin/mod_product_option.html.twig
msgid "Clients see it on the order form, the service page and invoices."
msgstr "Stranke ga vidijo na naročilnem obrazcu, strani storitve in računih."

#: src/modules/Invoice/templates/admin/mod_invoice_gateways.html.twig
msgid "Clients see the payment methods in this order; the first one they can use is picked by default."
msgstr "Stranke vidijo načine plačila v tem vrstnem redu; prvi, ki ga lahko uporabijo, je izbran privzeto."

#: src/modules/Clientfence/templates/admin/mod_clientfence_setup.html.twig
msgid "Clients see your instructions and you mark the invoice paid."
msgstr "Stranke vidijo vaša navodila, vi pa račun označite kot plačan."

#: src/modules/Client/templates/admin/mod_client_settings_id_documents.html.twig
msgid "Clients who are asked upload the front and back of an ID document (JPG, PNG, WebP or PDF) on their ID document page. Staff approve or refuse it on the client's ID documents tab, and the client gets an email either way. Orders of a client asked by the first two rules wait for review until the document is approved; approving it lets them go on. The files are encrypted and only staff can download them."
msgstr "Vprašane stranke na strani Osebni dokument naložijo sprednjo in zadnjo stran osebnega dokumenta (JPG, PNG, WebP ali PDF). Osebje ga odobri ali zavrne na zavihku Osebni dokumenti stranke in stranka v obeh primerih prejme e-poštno sporočilo. Naročila stranke, vprašane po prvih dveh pravilih, čakajo na pregled, dokler dokument ni odobren; odobritev jih spusti naprej. Datoteke so šifrirane in jih lahko prenese samo osebje."

#: src/modules/Clientfence/templates/admin/mod_clientfence_settings_store.html.twig
msgid "Clients who can order"
msgstr "Stranke, ki lahko naročajo"

#: src/modules/Invoice/templates/admin/mod_invoice_gateway.html.twig
msgid "Clients who pay with this gateway pay this fee: a line added to the invoice, changed when they pick another gateway. Credit pays no fee. Check that your card scheme and local law allow surcharges."
msgstr "Stranke, ki plačajo s tem prehodom, plačajo to pristojbino: postavko, dodano na račun, ki se spremeni, ko izberejo drug prehod. Dobroimetje ne plača pristojbine. Preverite, ali vaša kartična shema in lokalna zakonodaja dovoljujeta doplačila."

#: src/modules/Clientfence/Whmcs/Run.php
msgid "Clients whose credit matches"
msgstr "Stranke, katerih dobroimetje ustreza"

#: src/modules/Support/templates/admin/mod_support_network_issue.html.twig
