msgstr "V kopiji podatkovne zbirke sistema :system spremenite vsak besedilni stolpec prizadetih tabel v binarni tip (VARBINARY ali BLOB) in nato v besedilo utf8mb4. Tako se bajti ohranijo in berejo kot UTF-8. Sam ukaz CONVERT TO CHARACTER SET pusti besedilo neberljivo. Nato uvozite iz kopije."

#: src/modules/Clientfence/Whmcs/Preflight.php
msgid "In a copy of the :system database, repair only the affected rows, for each column: UPDATE tblclients SET col = CONVERT(CAST(CONVERT(col USING latin1) AS BINARY) USING utf8mb4) WHERE LOCATE(X'C383C2', CAST(col AS BINARY)) > 0 OR LOCATE(X'C382C2', CAST(col AS BINARY)) > 0; then import from the copy."
msgstr "V kopiji podatkovne zbirke sistema :system popravite le prizadete vrstice, za vsak stolpec: UPDATE tblclients SET col = CONVERT(CAST(CONVERT(col USING latin1) AS BINARY) USING utf8mb4) WHERE LOCATE(X'C383C2', CAST(col AS BINARY)) > 0 OR LOCATE(X'C382C2', CAST(col AS BINARY)) > 0; Nato uvozite iz kopije."

#: src/modules/Clientfence/Whmcs/Preflight.php
msgid "Install or enable PHP's zlib extension."
msgstr "Namestite ali omogočite razširitev zlib za PHP."

#: src/modules/Clientfence/Whmcs/Preflight.php
msgid "Installed (the add-on module archive is gzipped)."
msgstr "Nameščena (arhiv dodatnih modulov je stisnjen z gzip)."

#: src/modules/Clientfence/Whmcs/Preflight.php
msgid "Make the folder and let :user write it."
msgstr "Ustvarite mapo in uporabniku :user dodelite dovoljenje za pisanje."

#: src/modules/Clientfence/Whmcs/Preflight.php
msgid "Missing: the add-on module archive cannot be written."
msgstr "Razširitev manjka. Arhiva dodatnih modulov ni mogoče zapisati."

#: src/modules/Clientfence/Whmcs/Archive.php
msgid "No archive file was given."
msgstr "Arhivska datoteka ni bila navedena."

#: src/modules/Clientfence/Whmcs/Preflight.php
msgid "No double-encoded client names."
msgstr "Ni dvojno kodiranih imen strank."

#: src/modules/Clientfence/Whmcs/Preflight.php
msgid "Not UTF-8: :tables and :more more. Text in them may come over garbled."
msgstr "Tabele brez kodiranja UTF-8: :tables in še :more. Besedilo v njih je po uvozu lahko neberljivo."

#: src/modules/Clientfence/Whmcs/Preflight.php
msgid "Not UTF-8: :tables. Text in them may come over garbled."
msgstr "Tabele brez kodiranja UTF-8: :tables. Besedilo v njih je po uvozu lahko neberljivo."

#: src/modules/Clientfence/Whmcs/Preflight.php
msgid "Not a three-letter code: :codes."
msgstr "Kode, ki nimajo treh črk: :codes."

#: src/modules/Clientfence/Whmcs/Preflight.php
msgid "Not entered, and :system tickets have attachments: their messages would come over without the files."
msgstr "Mapa ni navedena, zahtevki v sistemu :system pa imajo priloge. Sporočila bi se uvozila brez datotek."

#: src/modules/Staff/templates/email/mod_staff_clientfence_signin_failed.html.twig
msgid "Open the staff panel"
msgstr "Odpri ploščo za osebje"

#: src/modules/Clientfence/Whmcs/Preflight.php
msgid "PHP zlib extension"
msgstr "Razširitev zlib za PHP"

#: src/modules/Clientfence/Whmcs/Preflight.php
msgid "Raise max_allowed_packet to :needed or more in the database server's settings."
msgstr "V nastavitvah strežnika podatkovne zbirke povečajte max_allowed_packet na najmanj :needed."

#: src/modules/Clientfence/Whmcs/Preflight.php
msgid "Raise memory_limit to 256M or more in the php.ini the console uses (php --ini names it), or run the console with php -d memory_limit=512M."
msgstr "V datoteki php.ini, ki jo uporablja konzola (php --ini pokaže datoteko), povečajte memory_limit na najmanj 256M ali zaženite konzolo z ukazom php -d memory_limit=512M."

#: src/modules/Clientfence/Whmcs/Preflight.php
msgid "Raise memory_limit to 256M or more in this site's PHP settings (php.ini or the hosting panel), then reload this page."
msgstr "V nastavitvah PHP tega spletnega mesta (php.ini ali nadzorna plošča gostovanja) povečajte memory_limit na najmanj 256M in znova naložite stran."

#: src/modules/Staff/templates/email/mod_staff_clientfence_signin_failed.html.twig
